1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,341
Modals shift too.

2
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:12,747
Can becomes could; may becomes might; must, meaning obligation, becomes had to; will and shall become would; and shall in an offer becomes should.

3
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:18,776
But would, could, might, should and ought to have no further past, so they never change.

